{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1547387-the-world-of-despoina-shard","id":1547387,"title":"The World of Despoina [Shard]","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Hunter: The Vigil"],"posts":[{"date":"2024-12-31T15:32:48-08:00","id":1547387,"title":"The World of Despoina [Shard]","content":"<i>Slowly entering the forum</i><br /> <br /> It's been a while, ha?<br /> <br /> So yeah, there were numerous real life stuff which made me pretty much blocked in terms of creative writing of any kind, but lately I finally had some ease of mind and decided to write some idea which I kept toying with for a lot of time- basically, a fantasy shard for Hunter, where I build the different countries by basing them around conspiracies and some compacts. Not sure how much traffic the forums get right now (would probably cross post it on Discord as well), but hey, it's Hunter material so maybe some people will find it of interest or something.<br /> <br /> Anyway, currently I finished the introduction and the first nation- Aegina, a <i>very</i> original name for the AKD. Updates would come hopefully on a daily to weekly basis. Also, happy new year and all of that!<br /> <br /> And now, welcome to the <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1dYZ-kD_H5WHiYSHuJIXAAqSAi530RN2KJC8bMgzn8UU/edit?tab=t.0\" target=\"_blank\">World of Despoina</a>, where the gods don't do their job, the mechanisms of reality slowly rot away and humans are left alone to keep the light burning against all odds, as well as numerous unnecessary references for Greek mystery religions because I listened too much to Epic: the Musical. Hope you'll like it!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-12-31T18:34:40-08:00","id":1547397,"title":"","content":"Replacing the gods or reawaking their drive could make an epic campaign.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-12-31T19:40:30-08:00","id":1547406,"title":"","content":"Will you be updating any other of your projects? Just curious. <br /> <br /> Will these counties be updated by alphabetical order or by your favorites?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-01-02T07:40:33-08:00","id":1547457,"title":"","content"